<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<resources>
    <!--
      The launch window, painted before Compose has a frame. It is the *start
      destination's* canvas, which is journal's — and journal moved to Logbook
      with its round, so this is Logbook `paper` (light here, dark in
      values-night). The handoff into the real theme is invisible in both.

      Flipping it is bound to the destination table's journal entry: paint the
      other system's canvas here and every cold start opens with one frame of
      the wrong page. `ShellSystemTest.journalIsLogbook` is the pin on the other
      half of that pair.
    -->
    <color name="window_background">#FBFAF7</color>
</resources>
